      "caveat": "The query alters 704 samples (70.7%) of the cohort's 996 samples; 292 samples are unaltered (profiled for every queried gene in every data type the query reads). A line's frequency is the samples it alters ÷ the samples profiled for its gene in any data type the line reads (their gene panels decide), a sample its panel does not cover is not profiled, never wild-type. The case table and the altered / unaltered lists follow the query's OQL; the gene-by-sample files list every call of each gene (OQL is not in effect), as the portal's do. DRIVER reads OncoKB v7.5. The case table: 996 samples. Sorted with altered samples first, then by sample id across the cohort; every page is a slice of that one order, and the download holds every row kept, with every column. ",
